{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0223_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6056f2be30b0557b7fbd14e4dd8b7869ade79d5c54987624ba5a0017ece93973", "ja": "（今日はまつりの『アイグラ！！』撮影だ。\nさて、そろそろ準備はできてるかな……？）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄まつり的《偶像写真！！》。好了，差不多准备好了吗……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
