{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0223_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "f8cd7ea915c9ccd384e77c7e2749e82ebcfafce6f6cfd63144e2dc0215e34e05", "ja": "ほ？　まつりはいつでも、やる気メラメラなのです。", "zh": "哦？小茉莉可是随时都干劲十足的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0223_1004_p", "source_sha256": "6f368d9111ba2a1c71146f7ba11253fdafa2e220cff6364bb5b5ed571cd39582", "ja": "それは良かった。燃えてるんだな……\n衣装もしっかり似合ってるぞ。", "zh": "那就好。看来干劲十足啊……\n这套服装也很适合你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0223_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "77415b07ac08f95e785d5abfdd836f560da92c2a8d0ab7a3b6ca3c9802b9da25", "ja": "当然なのです。\nどんな衣装も似合うのがまつり姫なのです♪", "zh": "那是当然的。\n无论什么样的服装，穿在茉莉公主身上都很合适呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0223_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "679d9067e4f4cb54bc74347c11a11d52c18a372d4945553629bf37202a25ee8a", "ja": "けど……{$P$}さんがどんな衣装を\n選んでくれるかは、ワクワクだったのです。", "zh": "但是……我一直很期待{$P$}先生会为我挑选什么样的服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0223_1007_p", "source_sha256": "34de3626d380f927b6a29123b514d9e1d81f8de8e651b83c440cfab471678480", "ja": "楽しみにしていてくれたんだな。\n衣装を用意した甲斐があったよ。", "zh": "原来你一直很期待啊。\n看来准备这套服装没有白费。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0223_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "88f23ce7590c68622b8deb3a1634bf42cc9ca7a4a76c71ec694e2f28e5eb0e80", "ja": "チャイナ服と言えば、セクシー！なのです。\nということは、つまり……。", "zh": "说起旗袍，就是性感！也就是说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0223_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ab45c7135003e71b90e1ac147ab74de0db2ffb5a3b88ae749f9a0e5210f08371", "ja": "つまり？", "zh": "也就是说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0223_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "343d543023d89aaeda8bb06d4642ab5a7e5d3442fa9187617e795b6aeda14f7d", "ja": "どんなふうに撮影をするのか、気になるのです！\n大人のまつりを見せる、くーる・びゅーてぃほー？", "zh": "人家很好奇要怎么拍摄！\n要展现成熟的祭，走酷炫美丽风？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0223_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "75dff078d0a959440eeaf071033a0c9cf8b33cb88ee6436371e53336ddc2f061", "ja": "それとも華麗な動きで、すぴーど・ぱわほー？\nまつりは、どっちもセクシーだと思うのです～。", "zh": "还是用华丽的动作，展现速度与力量？\n祭觉得两种都很性感哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0223_1012_p", "source_sha256": "78b6c3b66d7b165a70245514b9ae3e9dc6d027099d0267c2b0ca461db8e32b46", "ja": "そ、そうだな。まつりがやってくれるなら、どっちも\n迫力満点で頼もしいが、ここは無理せず自然に……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯，是啊。要是小祭愿意来做的话，不管哪一种都一定气势十足、很让人安心，不过这里还是别勉强，自然一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0223_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "abb70c039f41d49be6f9f75c8d231d942156af02b23e1017f63ae201a82b274a", "ja": "別に無理なんかしていないのですよ？\n女の子には、いろいろな顔があるのです♪", "zh": "人家才没有勉强自己呢？\n女孩子可是有各种各样的表情哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0223_1014_p", "source_sha256": "c8f6134bee8e1138c9b338f6596682b015022596109ccd8867b60e5b6bf20827", "ja": "そうか……じゃあ、もし今、カメラを向けたら\nまつりは、どんな顔を見せてくれるのかな。", "zh": "这样啊……那如果我现在把镜头对准你，茉莉会让我看到怎样的表情呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0223_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "d06c5f4f8822c47156cc999217a0de95ad6e2b05c7c1377966fd76bb1357dbdb", "ja": "今は……いつも姫を守ってくれる、\n大切なナイト様のために。", "zh": "现在……要为一直守护公主的、最重要的骑士大人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0223_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "ba176e72452009b00a3b9cb6d27910cf9285e03aea7633aec2001e48c48eeaa7", "ja": "隠された秘密のぱわー！で、伝説のお姫様のように……\n美しく、妖しく、艶やかに、魅力を伝えるのですよ♪", "zh": "用隐藏的秘密力量，让我像传说中的公主一样……美丽、妖娆、妩媚地传达魅力吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0223_1017_021mat", "source_sha256": "01cbd77fdc32fcaabce26a55087e903ac86de21a4084be75643d90c0bcdfcef2", "ja": "だから……がんばったら、ちゃんと褒めて\n欲しいのです。ね？　{$P$}さん。", "zh": "所以……要是我努力了，可要好好夸奖我哦。好吗？{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0223_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6ba1585a0b1aaff356a6894adc4e8ad33824b7955e6d149d7e2d5843222631e9", "ja": "あ、ああ。もちろんだ！", "zh": "啊，啊啊。当然！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0223_1019_p", "source_sha256": "efbd12b511fb1c2743dfa981d8b266ab8501a959ac32165deedc7679cc49e3e3", "ja": "（その後、まつりがファインダー越しに見せた\n艶やかな表情は……みんなを、大いにうならせた！）", "zh": "（之后，大家看到小祭透过取景器展现出的艳丽表情……都不禁赞叹不已！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
